# Files excluded from Shopify CLI operations (push, pull, dev).
#
# The CLI only syncs theme folders (assets, blocks, config, layout, locales,
# sections, snippets, templates) PLUS root-level AGENTS.md and DESIGN.md, which
# it treats as theme documentation. Everything else (src/, docs/, package.json,
# etc.) is never uploaded, so it doesn't need listing here.
#
# Syntax examples:
#   templates/product.json           a specific file
#   templates/*.json                 a wildcard pattern
#   /(templates|sections)/.*\.json/  a regular expression

# Developer/agent instructions: not useful inside the store's theme files.
AGENTS.md
